{"family": "retinaface", "task": "pose", "name": "RetinaFace", "plain": "RetinaFace (ResNet-50, MobileNet-0.25; biubug6 / facexlib): finds faces with a box and five landmarks (eyes, nose, mouth corners); the detector CodeFormer and GFPGAN use for face restoration. MIT.", "summary": "RetinaFace (Deng et al., CVPR 2020) in the facexlib / Pytorch_Retinaface version: single-stage face detection with five facial landmarks (eyes, nose, mouth corners), the detector of the CodeFormer / GFPGAN face restoration pipelines. A ResNet-50 or MobileNet-0.25 backbone, an FPN, SSH context modules and per-anchor face, box and landmark heads on the stride 8 / 16 / 32 maps. Takes the whole image at its own size (no resize, as facexlib's default `use_origin_size=True`); vendored from facexlib 0.3.0 (no facexlib / torchvision dependency). The portable `module()` maps the image to the raw head maps (anchor decoding and NMS stay outside).", "tier": "stable", "upstream": "https://github.com/xinntao/facexlib", "upstream_commit": "260620ae93990a300f4b16448df9bb459f1caba9", "original_is": null, "papers": [{"title": "RetinaFace: Single-stage Dense Face Localisation in the Wild", "url": "https://arxiv.org/abs/1905.00641", "date": "2019-05-02", "venue": "CVPR 2020", "variants": []}], "official": [{"repo": "https://github.com/deepinsight/insightface/tree/master/detection/retinaface", "framework": "MXNet", "reason": "The authors' MXNet release has no PyTorch weights; facexlib's PyTorch port (from biubug6/Pytorch_Retinaface) is the detector the face restorers use.", "variants": []}], "modes": ["portable", "kernels"], "portable_dtype": "float16", "kernels_dtype": "float16", "kernel_libs": ["box_nms", "cudnn_hacc", "fvm_conv", "fvm_extra", "fvm_mb", "fvm_r3"], "mps_kernel_libs": [], "mps_dtypes": ["float32", "float16"], "no_kernels_reason": "", "no_original_reason": "", "options": [{"name": "score_threshold", "default": 0.8, "bounds": "0.0 to 1.0", "effect": "output"}], "outputs": [{"name": "keypoints", "extra": false}, {"name": "keypoint_scores", "extra": false}, {"name": "boxes", "extra": false}, {"name": "scores", "extra": false}], "output_info": {"label_set": "face-5"}, "licence_files": ["LICENSE"], "licence_notes": [], "limitations": ["module() exports the raw per-level head maps; anchor decoding and NMS remain outside the exported graph.", "No per-landmark confidence: keypoint_scores repeats the face score.", "The image is not resized: large photos cost time and memory in proportion to their pixels; downscale them first for big faces."], "task_io": "Input: one RGB image and a box per person. Output: keypoints with confidence scores for every person.", "install": {"extras": [], "noncommercial_weights": []}, "variants": [{"id": "retinaface-resnet50", "released": "0.2.0", "added_in": "0.2.0", "ref": "retinaface-resnet50@1", "name": "retinaface-resnet50", "setting": "", "default_tag": false, "params": {"backbone": "resnet50"}, "licence": {"code": "MIT", "code_class": "permissive", "weights": "MIT", "weights_assumed": false, "evidence": "https://github.com/xinntao/facexlib/blob/260620ae93990a300f4b16448df9bb459f1caba9/README.md", "training_data": [{"id": "wider-face", "name": "WIDER FACE (32k images, 394k labelled faces)", "licence": "LicenseRef-research-only", "commercial": "no", "url": "https://web.archive.org/web/20261014221817/http://shuoyang1213.me/WIDERFACE/"}], "training_note": "WIDER FACE train with the RetinaFace five-landmark annotations; the ResNet-50 backbone starts from ImageNet classification weights", "commercial": "yes", "reasons": [], "notes": ["data: wider-face (non-commercial)"]}, "weights": [{"name": "detection_Resnet50_Final.pth", "sha256": "6d1de9c2944f2ccddca5f5e010ea5ae64a39845a86311af6fdf30841b0a5a16d", "size": 109497761, "url": "https://github.com/xinntao/facexlib/releases/download/v0.1.0/detection_Resnet50_Final.pth", "host": "GitHub", "member": null, "archive_size": null, "mirror": null}], "input_size": "any H x W >= 32, padded to a m